Word list license: nl (Nederlands)
==================================

The files words.txt and words-ascii.txt in this folder are made from the sources below.
Hekate changed this source. Hekate filtered the words and shortened the list.
The license of each source applies to the words that come from that source.

You may use this list for any purpose, including commercial use. You must give the credit of CREDITS.md, link the licenses, and say that the list was changed.

Sources
-------

1. ParlaMint 4.1, ParlaMint-NL (Dutch parliament) (version: 4.1, role: frequency)
   License: CC BY 4.0
   License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Home page: https://www.clarin.si/repository/xmlui/handle/11356/1912

2. ParlaMint 4.1, ParlaMint-BE (Belgian parliament, Dutch segments only) (version: 4.1, role: frequency)
   License: CC BY 4.0
   License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Home page: https://www.clarin.si/repository/xmlui/handle/11356/1912

3. OpenTaal word list (Dutch) (version: 2.20.19, role: lexicon)
